# MCP integration notes

- Transport: stdio (`StdioServerTransport`)
- Hosts typically run **one process per conversation** — process-scoped default `sessionId` relies on that
- Prefer the companion skill over always-on host rules for call habits
- Analysis text is sent to the configured second-opinion provider (Gemini by default, or local Ollama)
- Do not claim automatic background interception; tools run when invoked
